caption: Basic Origin Benefits
domain-rule: basic-origin-benefits

Eldritch Gifts is a hybrid Psi/Super Domain and grants the following baseline Origin-facing purchase permissions in addition to its Tradition-specific rules.

Basic Psionics: The character may purchase Basic/secondary Psi Power Talents and abilities under the shared Psi Origin rules. Secondary Psi Power Talents are normally capped at 2, and the character may normally maintain up to Will/5 such Talents. These Talents grant Basic access unless a Tradition explicitly grants broader access or changes either cap.

Super Attributes: The character may purchase ST, DX, IQ, and HT up to the character's natural Species cap +20% for that attribute. Attribute levels above 20 may use Super Attribute, +25%, from GURPS Supers to increase defaults beyond the Rule of 20. These are cap increases and purchase permissions, not free attribute levels.

Unless a more specific Tradition says otherwise, non-Talent traits purchased through these permissions follow the Eldritch Gifts Universal Origin Rule.
